290:Choose an outfit that is bright and fashionable with contrasting colors
291:Choose a sporty-looking casual wear made out of a comfortable fabric
292:Weak and helpless, but she sure can eat a lot
293:Warm, courageous, and kind
294:It's very normal. Everyone wears masks in modern society
295:I'm not used to it. I prefer to get along with people who are the same on the inside and the outside
296:Ask about students
297:Ask about the dojo
298:I better choose the suit with elegant colors
299:I better choose the colorful outfit
300:It's okay, I like this one, and I can take the jacket off
301:It's my honor to help a lady out. Actively offer to help her find the fox
302:It's a virtue to not make trouble for others. Let the staff deal with it
